WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.047
Use the decision helper as a starting point rather than a benchmark.

00:00:04.047 --> 00:00:11.362
Consider task difficulty, privacy requirements, available hardware, and latency goals.

00:00:11.362 --> 00:00:17.367
Then validate the recommendation by running real examples through candidate models.

00:00:17.367 --> 00:00:21.072
Use the recommendation as a starting hypothesis.

00:00:21.072 --> 00:00:25.095
The final decision should come from real measurements on your workload.
